{"name": "s3", "dur": 41.51, "lines": [{"id": "u01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.31, "clip": 0.3, "text": "AI 芯片的新闻，", "ch": [0.35, 0.457, 0.563, 0.67, 0.777, 0.883, 0.99, 1.097, 1.203], "sub": null, "big": "AI 芯片的新闻，", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "u02", "t0": 1.71, "t1": 3.08, "clip": 1.66, "text": "天天在说速度翻倍。", "ch": [1.71, 1.862, 2.014, 2.167, 2.319, 2.471, 2.623, 2.776, 2.928], "sub": null, "big": "天天在说速度翻倍。", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "u03", "t0": 3.48, "t1": 6.74, "clip": 3.43, "text": "可这就像汽车说最高时速 300，没说是在什么路上跑的。", "ch": [3.48, 3.598, 3.715, 3.833, 3.95, 4.068, 4.185, 4.303, 4.42, 4.538, 4.655, 4.773, 4.891, 5.008, 5.126, 5.243, 5.361, 5.486, 5.612, 5.737, 5.862, 5.988, 6.113, 6.238, 6.364, 6.489, 6.615], "sub": "最高时速 300，在什么路上？", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "u04", "t0": 6.99, "t1": 8.93, "clip": 6.94, "text": "看懂这类新闻，先问三个问题。", "ch": [6.99, 7.121, 7.253, 7.384, 7.516, 7.647, 7.779, 8.06, 8.184, 8.309, 8.433, 8.557, 8.681, 8.806], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "u05", "t0": 9.38, "t1": 11.2, "clip": 9.31, "text": "第一问：在什么路上跑出来的？", "ch": [9.38, 9.502, 9.625, 9.747, 10.02, 10.138, 10.256, 10.374, 10.492, 10.61, 10.728, 10.846, 10.964, 11.082], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "u06", "t0": 11.45, "t1": 16.05, "clip": 11.4, "text": "同样写着 224G，一个能推过一米长的铜缆，一个只跑几厘米。", "ch": [11.45, 11.605, 11.76, 11.915, 12.07, 12.225, 12.38, 12.535, 12.69, 12.845, 13.15, 13.29, 13.43, 13.57, 13.71, 13.85, 13.99, 14.13, 14.27, 14.41, 14.55, 14.69, 15.01, 15.14, 15.27, 15.4, 15.53, 15.66, 15.79, 15.92], "sub": "同样 224G：一米，还是几厘米", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "u07", "t0": 16.5, "t1": 18.92, "clip": 16.45, "text": "第二问：每传一个比特，花多少电？", "ch": [16.5, 16.615, 16.73, 16.845, 17.07, 17.23, 17.39, 17.55, 17.71, 17.87, 18.03, 18.33, 18.448, 18.566, 18.684, 18.802], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "u08", "t0": 19.17, "t1": 25.32, "clip": 19.11, "text": "每个比特的电降不下来，速度翻倍，电费也跟着翻倍；几万颗芯片一起跑，这就是真金白银。", "ch": [19.17, 19.302, 19.434, 19.565, 19.697, 19.829, 19.961, 20.093, 20.225, 20.356, 20.488, 20.76, 20.888, 21.016, 21.144, 21.272, 21.59, 21.735, 21.88, 22.025, 22.17, 22.315, 22.46, 22.605, 23.01, 23.143, 23.277, 23.41, 23.543, 23.677, 23.81, 23.943, 24.077, 24.31, 24.436, 24.563, 24.689, 24.815, 24.941, 25.068, 25.194], "sub": "速度翻倍，电费也翻倍", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "u09", "t0": 25.77, "t1": 28.9, "clip": 25.72, "text": "第三问：是 PPT 上的速度，还是真芯片测出来的？", "ch": [25.77, 25.906, 26.042, 26.178, 26.314, 26.426, 26.537, 26.648, 26.76, 26.871, 26.982, 27.094, 27.205, 27.316, 27.428, 27.539, 27.675, 27.811, 27.947, 28.083, 28.22, 28.356, 28.492, 28.628, 28.764], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "u10", "t0": 29.95, "t1": 31.51, "clip": 29.89, "text": "做出来、测出来，才算数。", "ch": [29.95, 30.08, 30.21, 30.34, 30.47, 30.6, 30.73, 30.86, 30.99, 31.12, 31.25, 31.38], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "u11", "t0": 31.96, "t1": 32.71, "clip": 31.9, "text": "一句话带走：", "ch": [31.96, 32.085, 32.21, 32.335, 32.46, 32.585], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "u12", "t0": 32.96, "t1": 36.44, "clip": 32.9, "text": "下次看到速度翻倍，先问：什么路？多少电？测过没有？", "ch": [32.96, 33.099, 33.238, 33.378, 33.517, 33.656, 33.795, 33.934, 34.074, 34.213, 34.352, 34.491, 34.63, 34.77, 34.909, 35.048, 35.187, 35.326, 35.466, 35.605, 35.744, 35.883, 36.022, 36.162, 36.301], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "u13", "t0": 36.69, "t1": 39.91, "clip": 36.63, "text": "下一条：信号上路以后，为什么会越跑越模糊？", "ch": [36.69, 36.843, 36.997, 37.15, 37.303, 37.457, 37.61, 37.763, 37.917, 38.07, 38.223, 38.377, 38.53, 38.683, 38.837, 38.99, 39.143, 39.297, 39.45, 39.603, 39.757], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}], "shots": [{"kind": "x2", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "u01", "t1": 9.08}, {"kind": "road", "t0": 9.08, "paper": false, "first": "u05", "t1": 16.2}, {"kind": "power", "t0": 16.2, "paper": false, "first": "u07", "t1": 25.47}, {"kind": "ppt", "t0": 25.47, "paper": false, "first": "u09", "t1": 31.66}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 31.66, "paper": true, "first": "u11", "type": [{"text": "一句话带走", "line": "u11", "from": null, "to": null}, {"text": "什么路？多少电？", "line": "u12", "from": "什么路", "to": "多少电"}, {"text": "测过没有？", "line": "u12", "from": "测过", "to": "没有"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 41.51}], "hudIn": 9.08}